sequenceDiagram
  actor Seller
  participant UI as React Sale
  participant API as FastAPI draft route
  participant AI as Provider adapter
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  Seller->>UI: Enter text or record; explicitly request draft
  UI->>API: Authenticated draft request
  API->>API: Check membership, limits and input
  API->>AI: Extract operation fields
  AI-->>API: Structured extraction / failure
  API->>API: Validate evidence, amounts and unknown payment
  API->>DB: Store draft only, no ledger operation
  API-->>UI: Draft or explicit error / manual fallback
  Seller->>UI: Review, correct, choose client and confirm
  UI->>API: POST operations + stable idempotency key
  API->>DB: Atomic validated ledger write
  DB-->>API: Persisted operation / existing result
  API-->>UI: Saved result and balance
